# This directory contains generated Crawlee scraper scripts.
# Scripts are created by Claude Code when analyzing event source URLs.
# The Clojure backend runs all *.js files here on a schedule.
#
# Each script must:
# 1. Output JSON array to stdout
# 2. Each event: {title, date, time, location, description, url}
# 3. Exit 0 on success, non-zero on failure
